  "title": "FLM 2 · Topic 2: Activity-Centered Design approach (Chapter 4-7) (sessions 7–30)|||FLM 2 · Topic 2: Activity-Centered Design approach (Chapter 4-7) (buổi 7–30)",
  "description": "Sessions 7–30 of the FLM plan.|||Buổi 7–30 theo kế hoạch FLM.",
