    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADT401 · Chapter 2 · Session 14</span>\n<h2>Session 14 — Topic 3: Card Sorting technique and Mental Model (Chapter 8-9)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13377 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADT401 · Chương 2 · Buổi 14</span>\n<h2>Buổi 14 — Topic 3: Card Sorting technique and Mental Model (Chapter 8-9)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13377 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">6</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Topic 3: Card Sorting technique and Mental Model (Chapter 8-9)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>- Text book - Chapter 8-9<br>- PPT Slides<br>- Lecturer's material</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Review<br>Discussion<br>Class Practice</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>QN1</strong> — What kind of typo and branding you will use for your game idea? Provide several hifi based on the screen flow above?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Session14-Offer Undo (6 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the session number in the deck name. File: Session14-Offer Undo.pdf</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Session14-Offer Undo (6 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số buổi ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: Session14-Offer Undo.pdf</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/001.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 1: Instead of Interrupting, Offer Undo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 1/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Instead of Interrupting, Offer Undo</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/002.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 2: Alert, Confirmation Dialogs or bothering Dialogs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 2/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Alert, Confirmation Dialogs or bothering Dialogs</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/003.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 3: WHAT YOU INTENDED:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 3/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>WHAT YOU INTENDED:<br>                             Important Warning<br><br>Dear user, you are about to do something dangerous. Please take a moment to<br>consider whether you really want to do this.<br><br> My goodness, thanks for preventing me from doing          Nah, I’m sure.<br><br>WHAT PEOPLE ACTUALLY SEE:<br><br>                            Annoying Interrupton<br><br>Even though you are working on something important, I’m going to interrupt<br>you now because blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah blah.<br><br>                              Whatever, leave me alone, I’m working here</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/004.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 4: Let Users Undo their Actions\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 4/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Let Users Undo their Actions<br><br> Instead of forcing people to deal with constant warn-   You have to cover as many actions as possible and<br> ings, Undo offers a simple, transparent solution        offer multilevel, “deep” undo, which allows the user to<br>                                                         undo more than just the most recent action.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/005.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 5: Temporary Undo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 5/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Temporary Undo<br><br>In some situations where implementing undo is impossible for technical reasons. One solution to this is to delay the action and allow the<br>user to undo it temporarily.<br>Example: Instead of sending the mail right away, show an undo button for a few seconds. If the user undoes the action, don’t send the<br>mail. Otherwise, remove the undo button and send the mail.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ADT401/flm1/d16/006.webp\" alt=\"ADT401 · Session14-Offer Undo · slide 6: Takeaway Points\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session14-Offer Undo · slide 6/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Takeaway Points<br><br>•   Warning people before they do something potentially dangerous doesn’t work, because people ignore these warnings.<br>•   Instead, allow people to undo their actions so that they can revert accidents.<br>•   If it is not technically possible for you to offer undo, at least delay the potentially dangerous action so that people can prevent it from happening even<br>    after issuing the command.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
